    "id": "w-u58-06",
    "unit": "u58",
    "prompt": "Write a note for Vale, who has just taken over the tile cleaning, describing how the original tiles feel and look after the work. Explain what is crooked or leaning, and what feels rough or smooth. Someone your age; casual register.",
