  {
    "id": "w-u58-07",
    "unit": "u58",
    "prompt": "Write a short piece for the newsletter about how the work and the neighbourhood change together over the weeks. Use fine comparisons and show two things changing at the same time. Address all the readers, who are your neighbours.",
