    "unit": "u58",
    "prompt": "Write a message to don Efraín, Hernando's old taxi friend, whom you call usted. He has offered to bring your guests to the café. Explain how to get there, mentioning distance in blocks and where to turn, and suggest a detour to avoid traffic. Keep a polite, formal register.",
    "minWords": 150,
